// ---- Production geometry ----
// hidden=5120 qkv_size=12288 inner_size=6144 rank=48 (Qwen3.8-27B SSM layer):
// total rows 18528, qkv 12288x4200 = 51609600 B, gate 6144x4200 = 25804800 B,
// alpha/beta 48x5440 = 261120 B. All-zero weights decode to zero, so every
// output must be exactly 0. Run with the matching config.

